{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_mysterious_man_0001", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_mysterious_man", "created_at": "第 1 日 00:10", "created_turn": 0, "summary": "目标房间内传来轻微的精神力波动，有人在尝试占卜我。对方是个新手，序列不高，但已经觉醒。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_mysterious_man_0002", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_mysterious_man", "created_at": "第 1 日 00:20", "created_turn": 1, "summary": "我在佐特兰德街监视目标公寓时，似乎感觉到有微弱的灵性波动从街角方向传来，但很轻微，可能是路过的野猫或醉汉。我没有发现目标离开房间。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_bartender_0001", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_bartender", "created_at": "第 1 日 00:50", "created_turn": 2, "summary": "一个陌生年轻人进入酒吧，看起来像是新晋非凡者，穿着普通，神情警惕但缺乏经验。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_tarot_reader_0001", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_tarot_reader", "created_at": "第 1 日 00:50", "created_turn": 2, "summary": "一个带有占卜家途径灵性波动的年轻人进入酒吧，可能同行或猎物。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_bartender_0002", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_bartender", "created_at": "第 1 日 01:00", "created_turn": 3, "summary": "一个年轻非凡者向我打听狂乱人偶线轴和欢笑面具碎片，还问起寂静之影。他之后匆忙离开，朝码头方向去了。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_tarot_reader_0002", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_tarot_reader", "created_at": "第 1 日 01:00", "created_turn": 3, "summary": "那个占卜家途径的年轻人向酒保打听消息后，立刻离开酒吧往码头方向去了。他似乎很着急。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_slender_man_0001", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_slender_man", "created_at": "第 1 日 01:05", "created_turn": 4, "summary": "一个模糊的身影在烟雾中从后窗潜入，抢走了我刚刚交易的狂乱人偶线轴。体型偏瘦，动作敏捷，穿着深色衣服。朝码头东侧逃跑。我开了两枪但没打中。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_collector_0001", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_collector", "created_at": "第 1 日 01:05", "created_turn": 4, "summary": "一个年轻人用烟雾制造混乱，从后窗潜入抢走了我出售的线轴。动作快，有备而来。他可能知道线轴的价值，或者受人指使。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "mem_npc_goon_0001", "node_type": "Memory", "npc_id": "npc_goon", "created_at": "第 1 日 01:05", "created_turn": 4, "summary": "我听到侧门外有动静，冲出去查看时发现一堆麻绳在燃烧。然后听到仓库内传来喊声和枪声，等我返回时，老板（瘦高个）说包裹被抢了，一个黑影从后窗跑了。", "source": "inferred", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "interp_npc_slender_man_0001", "node_type": "Interpretation", "npc_id": "npc_slender_man", "created_at": "第 1 日 01:05", "created_turn": 4, "summary": "这个抢夺者可能跟踪了我们，或者一直埋伏在仓库附近。他知道交易时间和地点，目标明确——只拿线轴，不伤人。可能是另一个收藏家派来的，或者是那个被寂静之影追踪的年轻非凡者。", "source_memory_id": "mem_npc_slender_man_0001", "visibility": "private"}
{"record_type": "node", "id": "interp_npc_collector_0002", "node_type": "Interpretation", "npc_id": "npc_collector", "created_at": "第 1 日 01:05", "created_turn": 4, "summary": "这个年轻人不像是职业盗贼——动作不够老练，但胆量不小。他可能急需线轴晋升，或者背后有势力在支持他。无论如何，这笔交易暴露了，我需要换个地方避避风头。", "source_memory_id": "mem_npc_collector_0001", "visibility": "private"}
